OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with some patchy
OL,7,Flight rain possible. Staying cloudy
OL,8,Fovernight with further outbreaks of
OL,9,Flight rain and freshening southeast
OL,10,Fwinds. A milder night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy with rain at
OL,13,Ftimes, likely turning heavier and more
OL,14,Fpersistent later. Quite breezy around
OL,15,Fthe coasts. Best chance of any
OL,16,Fbrightness towards the Buchan coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
